  "name": "Fascinate",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 1st level, a bard can use his performance to cause one or more creatures to become fascinated with him. Each creature to be fascinated must be within 90 feet, able to see and hear the bard, and capable of paying attention to him. For every three levels a bard has attained beyond 1st, he can target one additional creature with this ability. Each creature within range receives a Will save (DC 10 + half the bard's level + his Charisma modifier) to negate the effect. Fascinate is a mind-affecting ability that relies on audible and visual components.</p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
